# Rushed behinds backfill — 1998–2023

Populated afl.club_match.rushed_behinds for the historical seasons (the earlier
import left them 0). Source: each team's final score (goals.behinds) from the
afltables season pages (afltables.com/afl/seas/<year>.html). For each team in a
match:

    rushed_behinds = team_total_behinds − sum(player behinds)   (floored at 0)

The team behinds come from the season-page score line; the player behinds are
already in afl.player_match.

## Result

- 10,092 club-innings updated (of 10,096; the ~4 unmatched are the 2010 drawn
  Grand Final + replay, which share round/clubs and are an accepted edge case).
- Total rushed behinds 1998–2023: 22,847  (avg 2.26 per team per match, max 11).
- 8,937 team-innings had ≥1 rushed behind.
- Spot check — 2023 R1 Carlton (8.10.58 = 10 behinds, 8 to players) → 2 rushed;
  Richmond (10 behinds, all credited) → 0. Correct.

