## Note

One-off DB enrichment (not part of the import CLI). Re-run: scrape season pages
for team behinds, load to a staging table keyed by (year, round, club), then
UPDATE club_match.rushed_behinds = GREATEST(0, team_behinds − Σ player behinds).
